OL,3,GNEWSACity collection in new home search
OL,4,Aas lease expires
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who has transformed a collection
OL,7,Fof memorabilia into a free museum
OL,8,Fvisited by thousands from the UK and
OL,9,Fround the world now fears it could lose
OL,10,Fits home.
OL,12,FScott Duffin's Coventry Collection,
OL,13,Fmade up of around 100,000 items
OL,14,Fdocumenting the city's past, is based
OL,15,Fin Coventry Market but faces an
OL,16,Funcertain future when its lease expires
OL,17,Fin October.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
